{
  "note": "TEST ONLY. Hand-maintained SDK test table for local user-key transfer documents (docs/design/user-keys.md): key envelopes and server-issued client transfer credentials. Assembled by string concatenation from spec/fixtures/keys.json values and the fixed canonical templates; no cryptographic operation was executed while authoring this file. Consumers must derive and re-check every value themselves at test time (seed-to-public derivation, kid hashes, URL policy). Never use these keys outside tests. Seed base64url d-strings were corrected in revision 2 for transcription defects in the authored strings (alice -5PM to _5PM, carol ihXW to ihcW); later language runners must independently decode and compare every d with keys.json seed_hex. Revision 3 adds credential audience escaping/Unicode controls and escaped-equivalent and inner duplicate-name cases.",
  "schema": "user-key-transfer-fixtures/1",
  "document_templates": {
    "public_envelope": "{\"crv\":\"Ed25519\",\"kid\":\"<KID43>\",\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"type\":\"user-key/public\",\"v\":1,\"x\":\"<PUB43>\"}",
    "private_envelope": "{\"crv\":\"Ed25519\",\"d\":\"<SEED43>\",\"kid\":\"<KID43>\",\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"type\":\"user-key/private\",\"v\":1,\"x\":\"<PUB43>\"}",
    "client_credential": "{\"aud\":\"<AUD>\",\"client_key\":\"<PRIVATE_ENVELOPE_STRING>\",\"server_kid\":\"<KID43>\",\"server_public_key\":\"<PUB43>\",\"type\":\"user-key/credential/client\",\"url\":\"<URL>\",\"v\":1}"
  },
