    "server_identity_stand_in": "credentials use the keys.json vector svc as the server identity (public_key and kid only; a credential never carries server private material); the same document works with any active key as server stand-in",
    "composed_cases": "entries with a \"compose\" member are assembled by the test runner from the named source at test time; nothing pre-computed"
  },
